{"strongs": "H6083", "word": "עָפָר", "translit": "a.phar", "root": "עפר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "dry earth, dust", "definition": "עָפָר noun masculine Lev 14:42 dry earth, dust ; — absolute ׳ ע Gen 2:7 +, construct עֲפַר Gen 13:16 +; suffix עֲפָרֵךְ Ezek 26:12 , עֲפָרוֺ Deut 9:21 , etc.; plural construct עַפְרֹת Job 28:6 ; Prov 8:26 — 1. literally: \\ \\ a. dry, loose earth , thrown (in malice) 2Sam 16:13 (|| אֲבָנִים ); עַלרֿאֹשׁ ׳ וַיַעֲלוּ ע Josh 7:6 ( J E ; sign of grief), so Ezek 27:30 ; Lam 2:10 , and (with זָרַק ) Job 2:12 loose earth (on surface of ground) 1Kgs 18:38 ; Amos 2:7 ; Mic 1:10 ; Isa 34:7 ; Isa 34:9 ; Lev 17:13 ( H ) Ezek 24:7 (in figurative), Num 5:17 ; Job 14:19 ; Job 38:38 ; Job 39:14 ; Gen 26:15 ( R ), made into siege works Hab 1:10 of sand-storm Deut 28:24 (+ אָבָק ); as serpent's food, token of punishment and humiliation, Gen 3:14 ( J ) Isa 65:25 (compare Mic 7:17 2 e below); ׳ זֹחֲלֵי ע Deut 32:24 (poem; compare 2 e ). \\ \\ b. specifically as material of human body Gen 2:7 ; Gen 3:19 ( J ), Eccl 3:20 , compare Job 4:19 ; Job 8:19 ; Ps 103:14 , to which it returns ( שׁוּב אֶלֿ ) Gen 3:19 ; Job 10:9 ; Ps 104:29 ; Eccl 3:20 so (with עַל ) Job 34:15 ; Eccl 12:7 . \\ \\ c. = surface of ground Exod 8:12 ; Exod 8:13 (twice in verse); ( P ; הָאָרַץ ׳ ע ), Job 19:25 ; Isa 25:12 ; Isa 26:5 (both || אֶרֶץ ), surface of (whole) earth Job 41:25 , ׳ מְחִלוֺת ע Isa 2:19 (for hiding), so ׳ ע alone v Isa 2:10 , compare ׳ חֹרֵי ע Job 30:6 = soil , Job 5:6 ; Job 14:8 . \\ \\ d. powder of anything pulverized Deut 9:21 (twice in verse) (compare דָּ֑ק || Exod 32:20 ), 2Kgs 23:6 (twice in verse); 2Kgs 23:12 ; 2Kgs 23:15 , so in simile 2Sam 22:43 = Ps 18:43 , hence = ashes v Ps 18:4 ; Num 19:17 . \\ \\ e. debris , of ruined city 1Kgs 20:10 ; Ezek 26:4 ; Ezek 26:12 ; Neh 3:34 ; Neh 4:4 ; Ps 102:15 . The following are late: feminine earth of the grave: אֶשְׁכַּב ׳ לֶע Job 7:21 , so (with עַל ) Job 20:11 ; Job 21:26 , compare Job 17:16 ׳ יוֺרְדֵי ע Ps 22:30 , ׳ שֹׁכְנֵי ע Isa 26:19 , ׳ יְשֵׁנֵי אַדְמַתעֿ Dan 12:2 עֲפַרמָֿוֶת Ps 22:16 ׳ ע in figure Ps 30:10 . \\ \\ g. mortar (i.e. dried mud) for plastering houses Lev 14:41 ; Lev 14:42 ; Lev 14:45 ( P ). \\ \\ h. (iron-) ore Job 28:2 עַפְרֹת זָהָב v Job 28:6 gold-dust (but see סַפִּיר ). \\ \\ i. material of earth Isa 40:12 , compare ראֹשׁ עַפְרֹת תֵּבֵל Prov 8:26 the first of the earth particles of the world. 2. figurative: \\ \\ a. of abundance Gen 13:16 (twice in verse); Gen 28:14 (all J ) 2Chr 1:9 ; Job 27:16 ; Ps 78:27 (|| חוֺל יַמִּים ), compare עֲפַר יַעֲקֹב Num 23:10 ( J E ); with added idea of commonness, worthlessness Zeph 1:7 ; Zech 9:3 . \\ \\ b. of worthlessness (alone) Job 22:24 . \\ \\ c. simile of the scattered, dispersed 2Kgs 13:7 ׳ כֶּע Isa 41:2 (so van d. H. Ginsb ; Baer ׳ כֵּע ; on meaning see Du Che , reading תְּשִׂימֵם for יִתֵּן ). \\ \\ d. of self-abasement Gen 18:27 (+ אֵפַר ), ׳ וְנִחַמְתִּי עַלעֿ וָאֵפֶר Job 42:6 , פִּיהוּ ׳ יִתֵּן בֶּע Lam 3:29 . \\ \\ e. of humiliation (sitting or lying in dust) Isa 47:1 compare Isa 29:4 (twice in verse), Job 16:15 ; Job 40:13 ; Ps 7:6 ; Ps 44:26 ; Ps 119:25 , simile Job 30:19 licking dust Ps 72:9 ; Isa 49:23 ; Mic 7:17 , compare Tel Amarna tikalu ipra (of enemies, see Wkl Altor. Forsch. iii. 291 ; also of serpent 1 a above); of ׳ י raising from the dust 1Sam 2:8 = Ps 113:7 , 1Kgs 16:2 of lifting oneself Isa 52:2 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6257')\">BDB6257</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6083')\">H6083</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6256')\">BDB6256</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6258')\">BDB6258</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עָפָר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Lev 14:42\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,42)\">Lev 14:42</ref></sup> <highlightword>dry earth, dust</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 2:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,7)\">Gen 2:7</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>עֲפַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 13:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,16)\">Gen 13:16</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>עֲפָרֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,12)\">Ezek 26:12</ref>, <bdbheb>עֲפָרוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 9:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,21)\">Deut 9:21</ref>, etc.; plural construct <bdbheb>עַפְרֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 28:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,6)\">Job 28:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,26)\">Prov 8:26</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> literally: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>dry, loose earth</highlight>, thrown (in malice) <ref ref=\"2Sam 16:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,16,13)\">2Sam 16:13</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אֲבָנִים</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>עַלרֿאֹשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וַיַעֲלוּ ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 7:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,6)\">Josh 7:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; sign of grief), so <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:30\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,30)\">Ezek 27:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 2:10\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,10)\">Lam 2:10</ref>, and (with <bdbheb>זָרַק</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Job 2:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,2,12)\">Job 2:12</ref> loose earth (on surface of ground) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:38\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,38)\">1Kgs 18:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 2:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,7)\">Amos 2:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 1:10\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(33,1,10)\">Mic 1:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 34:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,7)\">Isa 34:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 34:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,9)\">Isa 34:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 17:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,17,13)\">Lev 17:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,7)\">Ezek 24:7</ref> (in figurative), <ref ref=\"Num 5:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,17)\">Num 5:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 14:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,19)\">Job 14:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 38:38\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,38)\">Job 38:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 39:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,14)\">Job 39:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 26:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,15)\">Gen 26:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink></lookup>), made into siege works <ref ref=\"Hab 1:10\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,10)\">Hab 1:10</ref> of sand-storm <ref ref=\"Deut 28:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,24)\">Deut 28:24</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אָבָק</bdbheb>); as serpent's food, token of punishment and humiliation, <ref ref=\"Gen 3:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,14)\">Gen 3:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Isa 65:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,25)\">Isa 65:25</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Mic 7:17\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,17)\">Mic 7:17</ref> <b>2 e</b> below); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>זֹחֲלֵי ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,24)\">Deut 32:24</ref> (poem; compare <b>2 e</b>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> specifically as material of human body <ref ref=\"Gen 2:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,7)\">Gen 2:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 3:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,19)\">Gen 3:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:20\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,20)\">Eccl 3:20</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Job 4:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,19)\">Job 4:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 8:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,19)\">Job 8:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 103:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"103\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"103\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,103,14)\">Ps 103:14</ref>, to which it returns (<bdbheb>שׁוּב אֶלֿ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Gen 3:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,19)\">Gen 3:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 10:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,9)\">Job 10:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 104:29\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,29)\">Ps 104:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:20\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,20)\">Eccl 3:20</ref> so (with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Job 34:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,15)\">Job 34:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,7)\">Eccl 12:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> = surface of ground <ref ref=\"Exod 8:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,12)\">Exod 8:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 8:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,13)\">Exod 8:13</ref> (twice in verse); (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; <bdbheb>הָאָרַץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Job 19:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,25)\">Job 19:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 25:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,25,12)\">Isa 25:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 26:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,5)\">Isa 26:5</ref> (both || <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ</bdbheb>), surface of (whole) earth <ref ref=\"Job 41:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,25)\">Job 41:25</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מְחִלוֺת ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 2:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,19)\">Isa 2:19</ref> (for hiding), so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> alone v<ref ref=\"Isa 2:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,10)\">Isa 2:10</ref>, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חֹרֵי ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 30:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,6)\">Job 30:6</ref> = <highlight>soil</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Job 5:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,6)\">Job 5:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 14:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,8)\">Job 14:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <highlight>powder</highlight> of anything pulverized <ref ref=\"Deut 9:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,21)\">Deut 9:21</ref> (twice in verse) (compare <bdbheb>דָּ֑ק</bdbheb> || <ref ref=\"Exod 32:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,20)\">Exod 32:20</ref>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,6)\">2Kgs 23:6</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,12)\">2Kgs 23:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,15)\">2Kgs 23:15</ref>, so in simile <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:43\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,43)\">2Sam 22:43</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 18:43\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,43)\">Ps 18:43</ref>, hence = ashes v<ref ref=\"Ps 18:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,4)\">Ps 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 19:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,19,17)\">Num 19:17</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <highlight>debris</highlight>, of ruined city <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,10)\">1Kgs 20:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,4)\">Ezek 26:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,12)\">Ezek 26:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:34\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,34)\">Neh 3:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 4:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,4)\">Neh 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 102:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"102\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"102\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,102,15)\">Ps 102:15</ref>. The following are late: <b>feminine</b> earth of the grave: <bdbheb>אֶשְׁכַּב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לֶע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 7:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,7,21)\">Job 7:21</ref>, so (with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Job 20:11\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,11)\">Job 20:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 21:26\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(18,21,26)\">Job 21:26</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Job 17:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,17,16)\">Job 17:16</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יוֺרְדֵי ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:30\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,30)\">Ps 22:30</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שֹׁכְנֵי ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 26:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,19)\">Isa 26:19</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְשֵׁנֵי אַדְמַתעֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 12:2\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,2)\">Dan 12:2</ref> <bdbheb>עֲפַרמָֿוֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,16)\">Ps 22:16</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> in figure <ref ref=\"Ps 30:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,30,10)\">Ps 30:10</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <highlight>mortar</highlight> (i.e. dried mud) for plastering houses <ref ref=\"Lev 14:41\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,41)\">Lev 14:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:42\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,42)\">Lev 14:42</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:45\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,45)\">Lev 14:45</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>h.</b> (iron-) <highlight>ore</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 28:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,2)\">Job 28:2</ref> <bdbheb>עַפְרֹת זָהָב</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Job 28:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,6)\">Job 28:6</ref> <highlight>gold-dust</highlight> (but see  <bdbheb><reflink>סַפִּיר</reflink></bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>i.</b> material of earth <ref ref=\"Isa 40:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,12)\">Isa 40:12</ref>, compare <bdbheb>ראֹשׁ עַפְרֹת תֵּבֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,26)\">Prov 8:26</ref> <highlight>the first of the earth particles of the world.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> figurative: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of abundance <ref ref=\"Gen 13:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,13,16)\">Gen 13:16</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Gen 28:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,14)\">Gen 28:14</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,9)\">2Chr 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 27:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,16)\">Job 27:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 78:27\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,27)\">Ps 78:27</ref> (|| <bdbheb>חוֺל יַמִּים</bdbheb>), compare <bdbheb>עֲפַר יַעֲקֹב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 23:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,10)\">Num 23:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); with added idea of commonness, worthlessness <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:7\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,7)\">Zeph 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 9:3\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(38,9,3)\">Zech 9:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of worthlessness (alone) <ref ref=\"Job 22:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,24)\">Job 22:24</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> simile of the scattered, dispersed <ref ref=\"2Kgs 13:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,13,7)\">2Kgs 13:7</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כֶּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,2)\">Isa 41:2</ref> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Ginsb</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כֵּע</bdbheb>; on meaning see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup>, reading <bdbheb>תְּשִׂימֵם</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>יִתֵּן</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> of self-abasement <ref ref=\"Gen 18:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,27)\">Gen 18:27</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֵפַר</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְנִחַמְתִּי עַלעֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>וָאֵפֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 42:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,42,6)\">Job 42:6</ref>, <bdbheb>פִּיהוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יִתֵּן בֶּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 3:29\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,29)\">Lam 3:29</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> of humiliation (sitting or lying in dust) <ref ref=\"Isa 47:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,47,1)\">Isa 47:1</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Isa 29:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,4)\">Isa 29:4</ref> (twice in verse), <ref ref=\"Job 16:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,15)\">Job 16:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 40:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,13)\">Job 40:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 7:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,7,6)\">Ps 7:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 44:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,26)\">Ps 44:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,25)\">Ps 119:25</ref>, simile <ref ref=\"Job 30:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,19)\">Job 30:19</ref> licking dust <ref ref=\"Ps 72:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"72\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"72\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,72,9)\">Ps 72:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 49:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,23)\">Isa 49:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 7:17\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,17)\">Mic 7:17</ref>, compare Tel Amarna <transliteration><highlight>tikalu ipra</highlight></transliteration> (of enemies, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wkl')\">Wkl<sup>Altor. Forsch. iii. 291</sup></lookup>; also of serpent <b>1 a</b> above); of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> raising from the dust <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,8)\">1Sam 2:8</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 113:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"113\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"113\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,113,7)\">Ps 113:7</ref>, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,2)\">1Kgs 16:2</ref> of lifting oneself <ref ref=\"Isa 52:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,2)\">Isa 52:2</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Lev 14:42", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 14, "verse": 42}, {"raw": "Gen 2:7", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Gen 13:16", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 13, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ezek 26:12", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 26, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Deut 9:21", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 9, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Job 28:6", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 28, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Prov 8:26", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "2Sam 16:13", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Josh 7:6", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 7, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ezek 27:30", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 27, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Lam 2:10", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 2, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Job 2:12", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 2, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Kgs 18:38", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 18, "verse": 38}, {"raw": "Amos 2:7", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Mic 1:10", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 1, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Isa 34:7", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 34, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 34:9", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 34, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Lev 17:13", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 17, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ezek 24:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 24, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Num 5:17", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 5, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Job 14:19", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 14, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Job 38:38", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 38, "verse": 38}, {"raw": "Job 39:14", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 39, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Gen 26:15", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 26, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Hab 1:10", "book": "HAB", "chapter": 1, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Deut 28:24", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 28, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Gen 3:14"